template/

# AI & Agent configurations, prompts, and planning artifacts are excluded per-clone from
# .git/info/exclude rather than here. Some agent read tooling refuses to return any path this
# file matches, so an entry here makes the instruction corpus unreadable to the agent that is
# required to load it, and a directory exclusion cannot be carved back out with a negation.
# `.githooks/pre-commit` refuses to commit them regardless. See docs/agents/README.md.
scorecard.png
packs/**/*.md

# The local documentation corpus (scripts/fetch-reference-docs.mjs) is excluded per-clone from
# .git/info/exclude rather than here, for the same read-tooling reason as the agent
# configuration above. Its one exception stays ignored here: the recovered Beta 1.7.3 client
# tree carries decompiled Mojang source, jars and assets that must never be published.
reference-docs/beta-1.7.3/

# Private deployment tooling (push builds and uploads to the hosted server). Kept out of
# the public repo so contributors never need server credentials; split into its own project
# when it outgrows the checkout.
betafied-manager/

# Local working copies of server worlds, left over from the world tools that used to live
# here. Still ignored so they never enter history.
.betafied-wipe/
.betafied-world/
